        Code-compliant panic bar and exit device installation for offices, retail stores, warehouses, and public-access facilities throughout Delaware. 1st Capital Locksmith installs, repairs, and replaces all types of commercial push bar exit hardware across Kent County.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 md:gap-4">
        <a
          href="tel:3027350050"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-[#A61E22] px-6 py-3 md:px-8 md:py-4 text-white font-bold text-base md:text-lg hover:bg-[#8C181B] transition"
