          { q: "What types of panic bars do you install?", a: "We install rim exit devices, mortise exit devices, vertical rod exit devices, and surface vertical rod devices. We work with brands including Von Duprin, Corbin Russwin, Sargent, ASSA ABLOY, and Adams Rite." },
          { q: "Can panic bars be keyed so the door locks from the outside?", a: "Yes. Most panic bar configurations allow key cylinders on the exterior side so the door can be locked from outside while always allowing free egress from inside. This is the standard configuration for most commercial applications." },
          { q: "Can panic bars be integrated into a master key system?", a: "Yes. Panic bar exterior cylinders can be keyed into a master key system so the same master key that opens other building doors also works on the exterior cylinder of panic bar doors." },
          { q: "Do you repair panic bars that are not working properly?", a: "Yes. We diagnose and repair stiff mechanisms, failed latches, loose mounting hardware, and damaged components. In many cases targeted repair is far less expensive than full unit replacement." },
